  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x399;&#x39F;&#x39C; - UMC Accommodation Center Kypseli I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this Action, IOM seeks to continue the operation of the Accommodation Center for UMC in the region of Kypseli (I), Attica, from 01/08/2023 to 31/07/2024, with a total capacity of 24 beds/places. UMC hosted in the Accommodation Center will be provided with dignified accommodation and will receive holistic support to cover  their basic needs and promote their personal growth. This will be achieved through the multiple services provided alongside the safe accommodation and will include psychosocial support, legal counselling, and provision of non-formal education in line with the children&#x2019;s best interests.</narrative>
  </description>
